A '''boulder''' can be encountered in the [[Scavenger beast|scavenger]] room within the [[Chambers of Xeric]]. It can be pushed aside in order to be granted access to a shortcut, yielding a small amount of reward points.

When attempting to push away the boulder, a check is made every couple of ticks in order to determine if enough force has been applied to dislodge it.{{CiteTwitter|author=Mod Ash|url=https://twitter.com/JagexAsh/status/1379746279685812229|date=7 April 2021|archiveurl=https://reldo.runescape.wiki/i/107837|archivedate=1 August 2023|quote=It's checking every couple of ticks to see whether there's enough pushing being done on either side, from all those engaged in pushing. It may therefore take a little time, especially if a group is needed.}} The chance to successfully push aside the boulder is based on the sum of the Strength levels of all players taking part in the endeavour.{{CiteTwitter|author=Mod Ash|url=https://twitter.com/JagexAsh/status/1402295047408783363|date=8 June 2021|archiveurl=https://reldo.runescape.wiki/i/97725|archivedate=1 August 2023|quote=I don't think we're sharing full details of that, but it periodically checks whether the players standing adjacent to it on each side (who appear to be actually pushing) have a combined Strength level sufficient to overcome its resistance.}}

